WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:02.449
Here's a tax team's workspace,

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.810
using fictional client data.

00:00:05.509 --> 00:00:08.469
The weekly overview shows what needs
attention.

00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:11.969
Open Approvals to review the missing
documents

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.729
and the reminders your agent has prepared.

00:00:15.409 --> 00:00:16.390
Check the wording,

00:00:16.829 --> 00:00:19.289
then choose an email reply to approve,

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.950
request changes, or decline.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.909
No email is sent in this demo.
